WEBVTT

00:12.360 --> 00:15.550
Hey, Nanami, let me show you something.

00:15.760 --> 00:17.320
Huh? What, what?

00:17.860 --> 00:20.360
Ah, little fish.

00:20.360 --> 00:22.370
How about it. Looks good, huh?

00:22.760 --> 00:24.200
You want it?

00:24.660 --> 00:26.440
Yeah, I do! I do!

00:26.560 --> 00:29.330
Well, this is a substitute for the favors I owe you.

00:32.570 --> 00:33.530
What's wrong?

00:36.960 --> 00:38.260
Well...

00:39.190 --> 00:41.460
I don't think it's like that.

00:41.660 --> 00:42.950
It's not like that?

00:43.260 --> 00:45.470
Since both borrowing and returning are the same,

00:45.660 --> 00:48.480
it doesn't mean it will become zero if it gets substituted.

00:48.560 --> 00:49.900
What are you talking about?

00:50.960 --> 00:54.140
That's what my mom taught me.

01:00.620 --> 01:02.190
But if what you say is true,

01:02.320 --> 01:04.420
the favors I owe you will grow more and more, right?

01:04.560 --> 01:05.750
But...

01:06.560 --> 01:11.420
If I owe a hundred favors, I'll listen to whatever you say, okay?

01:12.360 --> 01:13.620
Whatever I say?

01:13.960 --> 01:19.420
Yeah. Like if your boxed lunch has radishes, I can eat them for you.

01:21.450 --> 01:24.000
How about that?

01:25.060 --> 01:26.170
Okay.

01:27.460 --> 01:31.320
A favor to ask from you... what should I ask?

01:32.160 --> 01:35.930
Hey, why do you look like you've already won?

01:36.460 --> 01:38.900
That's because I'm confident about this.

01:39.180 --> 01:40.710
What?!

01:42.860 --> 01:46.370
I will never give this hairpin to the person who said those mean words.

01:47.560 --> 01:49.290
This one is enough for you.

01:52.460 --> 01:55.560
Ah, there's a crab on my head!

01:55.660 --> 01:57.600
Take it away! Get it off!

02:01.560 --> 02:03.680
That was so mean.

02:03.830 --> 02:06.270
That's because you were bragging.

02:07.910 --> 02:09.590
Now you owe me another favor.

02:10.460 --> 02:13.320
One or two isn't a big deal.

02:14.760 --> 02:18.320
You're the one who should be careful not to owe me a hundred favors.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.820
Well, that's impossible.

02:20.960 --> 02:22.860
I think Ken-chan should be careful.

02:22.990 --> 02:26.200
Once you reach a hundred, you have to listen to me, okay?

02:28.060 --> 02:30.690
That's my line.

02:31.390 --> 02:31.900
Come on.

02:38.460 --> 02:43.270
Two Person's Bond and a Swaying Memory

02:46.570 --> 02:50.380
I'm less stressed when Hikari isn't around after all.

02:50.560 --> 02:53.200
Hey, you're saying that again.

02:53.760 --> 02:55.750
But what you just said fits Hikari-chan.

02:55.760 --> 02:58.660
She said she would sleep enough for something tomorrow.

02:58.660 --> 03:01.130
She just slept for an entire day.

03:02.100 --> 03:04.500
If she doesn't come on our field trip,

03:04.660 --> 03:08.570
I'll be much happier.

03:09.060 --> 03:10.750
That's not true.

03:10.760 --> 03:13.770
We have fun on field trips because Hikari-chan is with us every year.

03:13.860 --> 03:15.070
Really?

03:17.760 --> 03:19.180
Tomosaka-kun!

03:19.960 --> 03:20.780
Tae-senpai.

03:24.160 --> 03:26.140
Tae-senpai, what's up?

03:27.260 --> 03:28.770
Actually, I was waiting for you.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.850
Are you free today, Tomosaka-kun?

03:31.160 --> 03:33.170
Speaking of free, yeah, I am.

03:33.760 --> 03:36.460
Can you accompany me after school then?

03:36.660 --> 03:38.900
Huh? It's fine really.

03:38.940 --> 03:40.780
Is there anything I can help with?

03:40.860 --> 03:45.740
Ah, well just Tomosaka-kun will be okay this time.

03:47.460 --> 03:48.820
Really?

03:48.960 --> 03:51.010
Yeah, sorry.

03:52.260 --> 03:55.950
Well, please do come by, Tomosaka-kun.

04:06.560 --> 04:08.800
Tae-senpai, I'm here.

04:13.010 --> 04:16.730
Huh? Sakura-san?

04:19.360 --> 04:22.110
Well, I'm really sorry.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.430
I asked you to come here all of a sudden.

04:24.960 --> 04:27.800
Ah, no. That's alright.

04:28.460 --> 04:31.110
But, where is Tae-senpai?

04:31.960 --> 04:35.150
Well... I...

04:36.760 --> 04:37.600
Um...

04:39.460 --> 04:42.960
I have something I want to tell you, Tomosaka-senpai.

04:54.060 --> 04:54.970
Ken-chan.

04:57.260 --> 04:59.730
What did Tae-senpai ask you to do?

05:00.360 --> 05:02.900
No, nothing special.

05:03.460 --> 05:04.590
What's wrong?

05:04.660 --> 05:06.190
Nothing.

05:24.660 --> 05:27.800
Great! I got a good seat!

05:31.560 --> 05:33.110
Are you still a kid?

05:33.460 --> 05:35.880
Well, I'll sit next to Hikari-san.

05:36.260 --> 05:38.340
Well, I'll sit next to Misora.

05:38.660 --> 05:39.870
Hey, wait!

05:39.960 --> 05:41.470
Why are you here?

05:41.660 --> 05:43.940
Ah? Isn't that okay?

05:44.260 --> 05:45.260
Right?

05:45.460 --> 05:47.830
When did you two become so close?

05:48.160 --> 05:50.660
And where did you get that uniform?

05:51.160 --> 05:53.960
This? Suzuka-chan lent this to me.

05:54.060 --> 05:55.390
Suzuka?

05:56.860 --> 05:58.960
She asked me and I couldn't refuse.

05:58.960 --> 06:00.000
You really should refuse.

06:00.260 --> 06:02.560
Look at how much trouble you give to Tae-senpai.

06:02.860 --> 06:04.260
Don't worry.

06:09.360 --> 06:10.460
That's fine,

06:11.060 --> 06:12.350
we have empty seats anyway.

06:14.060 --> 06:16.530
This is a countryside school.

06:16.830 --> 06:18.410
Isn't that good?

06:18.660 --> 06:20.370
We'll have a lot of fun.

06:20.760 --> 06:23.680
Don't mind such a trifle thing if you're a man.

06:23.760 --> 06:26.500
Good job, Hatano-kun, I'll allow you to sit here now.

06:26.610 --> 06:28.720
Ahh, great!

06:30.160 --> 06:32.870
Hey, let's sit in those seats.

06:33.370 --> 06:36.900
No, this time, Nanami-oneechan will sit with me.

06:37.160 --> 06:39.960
At least stay with the girls sometime and have a little chat.

06:41.960 --> 06:44.610
I want to talk with Konoe-san too.

06:44.860 --> 06:45.680
But...

06:45.960 --> 06:47.800
Well, it would be good sometimes.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.750
Ken-chan!?

06:49.160 --> 06:50.410
Well, all set.

06:50.660 --> 06:51.490
Tomosaka-kun.

06:53.960 --> 06:56.150
Please take care of Sakura-san.

06:56.360 --> 06:59.770
Huh? A-Ahh... Nice to see you.

07:01.060 --> 07:02.880
Nice to see you too.

07:13.560 --> 07:15.560
All right! Revolution!

07:13.560 --> 07:16.560
(Tl Note: A trump in the card game, called "Revolution.")

07:15.660 --> 07:16.600
No way!!

07:19.360 --> 07:22.480
From now on, you all can call me the revolution player, Hatano.

07:22.500 --> 07:23.510
Sorry...

07:23.830 --> 07:25.910
See that? Anti-revolution!

07:25.960 --> 07:27.250
Anti-revolution?

07:30.360 --> 07:31.200
I won.

07:31.760 --> 07:35.340
Awesome, Sakura, you won ten times straight.

07:37.160 --> 07:38.520
Thanks!

07:49.860 --> 07:54.920
In this case, throughout the field trip, we'll get closer to nature...

07:55.060 --> 07:57.860
and build our "love nature" minds.

07:58.360 --> 08:00.680
That's all for today.

08:00.960 --> 08:04.450
Everybody, please put your baggage into your rooms and then you all can enjoy your free time.

08:09.060 --> 08:11.260
Huh? What's up?

08:11.260 --> 08:12.660
N-Nothing.

08:14.660 --> 08:16.240
I'll take this to your room.

08:16.560 --> 08:18.430
Hmm, thank you.

08:20.660 --> 08:21.950
Hey, hurry up.

08:25.760 --> 08:26.550
Here you go.

08:27.120 --> 08:28.070
Thank you.

08:29.060 --> 08:29.680
Well...

08:30.560 --> 08:34.590
Well... Ken-chan... Something happened yesterday, right?

08:35.660 --> 08:36.440
Kenji!

08:37.960 --> 08:41.330
The room is awesome, hurry up and take a look!

08:42.060 --> 08:43.640
Well, later.

08:49.560 --> 08:51.690
Every other time we've had the same old room...

08:52.110 --> 08:54.010
This time, we've leveled up a lot, awesome.

08:55.060 --> 08:56.290
I'm coming.

08:57.360 --> 08:59.160
Ah, Hikari-chan!

08:59.160 --> 09:00.990
We're ready.

09:01.360 --> 09:02.360
Well, let's go.

09:06.060 --> 09:07.910
Everything is prepared.

09:11.760 --> 09:12.470
Moron...

09:28.560 --> 09:29.420
Ken-chan!

09:30.160 --> 09:30.740
Suzuka!

09:30.760 --> 09:33.070
Yes! Misora, it's coming your way.

09:33.100 --> 09:34.090
Okay!

09:34.760 --> 09:36.960
Attack!

09:37.660 --> 09:40.880
Don't underestimate me. Misora, receive!

09:43.060 --> 09:43.890
Not bad.

09:44.160 --> 09:45.670
Jumping, throwing!

09:46.960 --> 09:48.150
All right!

09:48.360 --> 09:50.220
Bring it on, Hikari-chan!

09:50.710 --> 09:53.230
Hikari, super attack!

09:57.060 --> 10:01.310
Me too! Misora, random attack!

10:02.260 --> 10:03.220
Sakura!

10:05.550 --> 10:09.190
Tomosaka-senpai, are you okay?

10:09.760 --> 10:11.270
I'm fine, I'm fine.

10:11.460 --> 10:12.460
Don't worry...

10:12.700 --> 10:13.420
So cold...

10:22.860 --> 10:26.470
You want to duel with me?

10:27.060 --> 10:28.770
Hey, wait up...

10:38.560 --> 10:41.740
What are they doing?

11:02.860 --> 11:04.410
Ah, tastes good.

11:05.360 --> 11:06.630
Great.

11:06.860 --> 11:10.980
I'm so lucky to be in the same group as Nanami-oneechan.

11:12.160 --> 11:15.160
It's the same no matter who makes the curry.

11:15.360 --> 11:20.130
Don't try to hide it. Once I taste it, I know you used your secret recipe as usual.

11:20.560 --> 11:21.730
Secret recipe?

11:22.060 --> 11:24.050
Onii-chan loves it a lot.

11:28.520 --> 11:29.680
Are you ready?

11:30.060 --> 11:31.220
Of course.

11:33.160 --> 11:33.930
Where's Hikari?

11:34.560 --> 11:36.390
Isn't she playing with Misora-san now?

11:36.860 --> 11:38.890
That's because Hikari-chan is super popular.

11:39.260 --> 11:42.490
In that case, who's looking after the pot?

11:49.960 --> 11:51.380
It seems a little sweet.

11:52.160 --> 11:54.290
Indeed, curry is supposed to be really hot.

11:54.660 --> 11:56.650
Ah, we're the same!

11:58.760 --> 12:01.910
(Bottle Label: Super Hot Seasoning.）

12:17.060 --> 12:19.190
Ah, it's just right, I mean the hotness.

12:19.260 --> 12:21.040
Yep, right?

12:27.760 --> 12:29.620
Sakura-san, how is it?

12:30.760 --> 12:32.550
You don't have to push yourself and eat it.

12:32.960 --> 12:36.200
No, really, it's very delicious.

12:36.860 --> 12:39.490
Hey, what do you mean?

12:39.860 --> 12:41.370
Right, Tae-senpai?

12:44.760 --> 12:47.510
That was so hot, right?

12:48.460 --> 12:51.040
I only had the rice.

12:57.060 --> 12:59.010
Ah, senpai, your nose.

13:00.960 --> 13:03.290
It has a foam bubble, let me wipe it off.

13:03.860 --> 13:06.570
It's fine, I can do it by myself.

13:07.960 --> 13:09.450
Don't move.

13:12.060 --> 13:14.700
Okay, it's clean.

13:16.260 --> 13:16.940
T-Thank you.

13:25.760 --> 13:29.000
Okay, now it's group dancing time.

13:30.360 --> 13:33.520
Please have fun, everybody!

13:35.360 --> 13:39.240
Hey, don't be shy, everyone.

13:44.660 --> 13:45.670
Hikari-chan.

13:46.660 --> 13:48.300
Huh? Don't tell me you want to...

13:49.360 --> 13:51.080
Please dance with me.

13:51.460 --> 13:53.810
Hmm, about this...

13:54.060 --> 13:56.450
Go ahead, Hikari-san, have some courage.

13:58.340 --> 14:00.310
I'll try to dance with Misora-chan.

14:01.560 --> 14:02.850
Of course.

14:07.860 --> 14:10.450
It seems like his heart is broken.

14:14.370 --> 14:15.960
Well... with Ken-chan...

14:15.960 --> 14:18.670
Nanami-oneechan, let's dance together.

14:18.810 --> 14:21.460
Hmm. Okay.

14:34.560 --> 14:35.400
Senpai...

14:42.160 --> 14:43.460
Senpai...

14:44.460 --> 14:47.970
I don't think it's going to work after all.

14:48.760 --> 14:49.600
What do you mean?

14:49.960 --> 14:53.210
Senpai and Konoe-senpai.

14:53.760 --> 14:55.880
Ah, we don't have anything anyway.

14:56.660 --> 14:57.580
No way...

14:58.260 --> 15:02.250
Please admit it... Admit it...

15:04.460 --> 15:07.190
Otherwise... I...

15:16.160 --> 15:18.450
She's really annoying.

15:18.890 --> 15:21.020
And she can't do anything by herself.

15:21.860 --> 15:22.570
But...

15:25.360 --> 15:27.300
But I'm still...

15:30.360 --> 15:32.180
I'm...

15:35.690 --> 15:36.980
Yeah...

15:45.660 --> 15:47.110
I knew that.

15:51.460 --> 15:53.200
Can you dance with me?

15:55.410 --> 15:56.310
Okay.

16:10.080 --> 16:12.930
Well, Tomosaka-senpai...

16:13.360 --> 16:15.600
Yeah, see you.

16:16.860 --> 16:20.050
Yes, goodbye.

16:44.360 --> 16:47.720
All right, everybody must be tired.

17:11.620 --> 17:12.560
I won.

17:13.090 --> 17:16.070
It hasn't been decided yet!

17:16.560 --> 17:19.890
How is it? Sakura-san?

17:20.280 --> 17:23.220
No, it's amazing...

17:23.780 --> 17:25.440
Is it?

17:29.190 --> 17:30.430
Open-air bath!

17:36.840 --> 17:37.830
What?

17:38.400 --> 17:40.390
We've lost...

17:51.560 --> 17:53.260
You've sorted your feelings now, right?

17:56.460 --> 17:57.340
Now...

17:58.060 --> 18:05.150
But... that was my first time seeing Konoe-senpai with that lonely expression.

18:06.660 --> 18:07.760
If I don't apologize...

18:11.060 --> 18:14.330
It's already late today. How about tomorrow, okay?

18:25.260 --> 18:26.950
Hikari-chan...

18:56.510 --> 18:57.260
Nanami.

18:59.660 --> 19:03.960
Well, about Sakura-san...

19:06.810 --> 19:07.590
Actually...

19:10.960 --> 19:12.390
She confessed her love to me.

19:20.060 --> 19:22.320
I'm here to make this confession without thinking about anything else.

19:23.760 --> 19:31.090
I, Sakura Hiromi, like Tomosaka-senpai.

19:32.700 --> 19:35.160
I don't think you remember.

19:35.660 --> 19:40.450
I started liking you ever since the first time I saw you.

19:42.460 --> 19:44.130
But I know.

19:45.060 --> 19:46.390
It's impossible.

19:47.660 --> 19:50.230
But I still want to tell you.

19:56.180 --> 19:56.910
I...

19:59.260 --> 20:00.650
I'm going to move away from here.

20:04.160 --> 20:08.100
After that, Tae-senpai asked me for a favor.

20:09.160 --> 20:12.020
'Give Sakura a good memory.'

20:12.760 --> 20:14.450
I see...

20:15.240 --> 20:18.470
I thought it would be better not to tell you.

20:19.160 --> 20:21.120
But you totally misunderstood me.

20:21.660 --> 20:22.550
Sorry.

20:27.760 --> 20:31.700
Hey, Ken-chan, I'm fine.

20:32.360 --> 20:35.510
Do your best and give Sakura a great memory.

20:36.660 --> 20:37.530
Nanami...

20:40.860 --> 20:43.710
The group dance, we didn't make it, right?

20:44.360 --> 20:46.840
Ah, I owe you that.

20:50.360 --> 20:53.980
Well, I can dance with you whenever you feel like.

20:54.760 --> 20:55.830
Ken-chan...

21:11.210 --> 21:13.510
Everybody must be tired from the field trip.

21:13.510 --> 21:15.210
The group dance was very good.

21:15.210 --> 21:16.310
What's wrong?

21:16.310 --> 21:19.310
That person invited shilly-shally me.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.010
Excuse me...

21:20.210 --> 21:22.610
The touching sparks the true love.

21:22.610 --> 21:23.710
Hello?

21:23.710 --> 21:26.750
Is my face red from the reflection of the fire?

21:27.510 --> 21:28.510
Are you listening?

21:28.510 --> 21:31.690
So good, group dance...

21:31.910 --> 21:34.990
Next on Lamune: The Distance Between the Two and the Lemonade Bottle

